aves, fruit and dead animals are broken down and return nutrients to the forest soil."}, {"id": "decomp", "sp": "decomposers", "xh": 0.95, "desc": "Fungi, bacteria and litter invertebrates break down dead plants and animals and recycle nutrients."}, {"id": "figs", "sp": "ficus", "xh": 0.1, "desc": "Rainforest figs fruit heavily and feed fruit bats, birds and ground feeders."}, {"id": "syzygium", "sp": "syzygium", "xh": 0.3}, {"id": "palm", "sp": "licuala ramsayi", "xh": 0.5}, {"id": "umbrella", "sp": "heptapleurum actinophyllum", "xh": 0.7}, {"id": "doughwood", "sp": "melicope elleryana", "xh": 0.88}, {"id": "cassowary", "sp": "casuarius casuarius", "xh": 0.06, "desc": "Forages on the forest floor for fallen fruit and seeds, including some that are toxic to other animals, and passes the seeds on in its droppings.", "ic": "quad"}, {"id": "flyingfox", "sp": "pteropus conspicillatus", "xh": 0.19}, {"id": "treeroo", "sp": "dendrolagus bennettianus", "xh": 0.32}, {"id": "ratroo", "sp": "hypsiprymnodon moschatus", "xh": 0.45}, {"id": "ulysses", "sp": "papilio ulysses", "xh": 0.58}, {"id": "pademelon", "sp": "thylogale stigmatica", "xh": 0.7}, {"id": "brushturkey", "sp": "alectura lathami", "xh": 0.82}, {"id": "ant", "sp": "oecophylla smaragdina", "xh": 0.94, "name": "Green tree ant", "tl": 2, "desc": "A weaver ant that builds leaf nests in rainforest trees."}, {"id": "monitor", "sp": "varanus varius", "xh": 0.2}, {"id": "toad", "sp": "rhinella marina", "xh": 0.42}, {"id": "bronzeback", "sp": "dendrelaphis punctulatus", "xh": 0.62}, {"id": "kookaburra", "sp": "dacelo novaeguineae", "xh": 0.82}, {"id": "python", "sp": "simalia kinghorni", "xh": 0.5}], "raw": [["sun", "figs", "r"], ["rain", "figs", "r"], ["soil", "figs", "r"], ["sun", "syzygium", "r"], ["rain", "syzygium", "r"], ["soil", "syzygium", "r"], ["sun", "palm", "r"], ["rain", "palm", "r"], ["soil", "palm", "r"], ["sun", "umbrella", "r"], ["rain", "umbrella", "r"], ["soil", "umbrella", "r"], ["sun", "doughwood", "r"